		"description": {
			"value": "<p>Your bestial side grants you heightened senses. The sense granted by this feat are active in all forms.</p><hr><p><strong>Crocodiline</strong> - You gain wavesense and an imprecise sense with a range of 30 feet.This allows you to sense vibrations in the water. Wavesense functions only if you and the subject are in the same body of liquid, and only if the subject is moving through the liquid.</p><p><strong>Lupine, Murine, Pantherine, Suine, Ursine</strong> - You gain scent as an imprecise sense with a range of 30 feet.</p><p><strong>Selachian</strong> - You gain bloodsense as an imprecise sense with a range of 20 feet. This allows you to sense the presence of creatures, living or dead, that have blood (this includes most creatures that aren't immune to bleed). You're similarly able to detect the presence of fresh blood in volumes of one pint or more, so long as it's no more than 24 hours old.</p><p><strong>Vespertiline</strong> - You gain echolocation with a range of 15 feet. This improves your hearing sense to precise.</p>",
